{{etyl|la}} mode that affirms

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[modus]] [[ponens]]|-}}

# {{context|philosophy|logic}} A [[valid]] form of [[argument]] in which the [[antecedent]] of a [[conditional]] [[proposition]] is [[affirm]]ed, thereby [[entail]]ing the affirmation of the [[consequent]].  Modus ponens has the form:
#: 1. If P, then Q.
#: 2. P.
#: 3. Therefore, Q.

